sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client Pod
    participant DNS as CoreDNS
    participant VIP as Service VIP
    participant Proxy as kube-proxy / dataplane
    participant Backend as Backend Pod
    Client->>DNS: Resolve service name
    DNS-->>Client: ClusterIP
    Client->>VIP: Connect
    VIP->>Proxy: Route decision
    Proxy->>Backend: Forward traffic
    Backend-->>Client: Response
